{"summary":"Brain-teasing puzzle game! Relax as you sort, stack, and tidy up objects.","description":"-TRY BEFORE YOU BUY~\nTry 9 puzzles from the main game, plus 3 Daily Tidy puzzles and 1 level from the Archive.\n\nA one-time in-app purchase opens up the original A Little to the Left experience with over 100 puzzles, complete access to the Daily Tidy Delivery and seasonal puzzles in the Archive. No ads.\n\nSort, stack, and organize household objects into just the right spot in A Little to the Left, a tidy puzzle game with a mischievous cat who likes to shake things up!\n\n- Over 100 unique logical puzzles.\n- Puzzles hidden among household objects.\n- Multiple solutions.\n- A puzzle unique for you every day with The Daily Tidy Delivery.\n- Perfect for casual puzzle game fans and those who get a jolt of satisfaction from a well organized space.\n- Feel free to skip levels with the \"Let It Be\" option, and choose when you want to tackle certain messes.\n- A unique hint system.\n- Intuitive drag and drop controls.\n- A mischievous (but very cute) cat.\n- Funny and playful, great for all ages!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rr2C2qq52Uo?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KfYAzPgrEVGa_vfu6u_5q5WduVIPXmfjFmZGoiw5QkNxvuj-7iIsKBupVjPBwmH0SBuWJ4i3ckJKqYq1XVWIMSM","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pCryHxJvRRrHsHJzALfk1N6nNaYOTfemDUpC51anh9t_nyVrrv36OX3izRvUxnNIHSKDsYK-N-H66iq9-okS8A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TpvB0pbkW99Bl5XO3wO48Z-AUDd5s0UWJrKPkkqDUDYE-7os7FsKddu35pN32dJ1TgC7nYxWFXf7SVUiqGpSzEk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ehvjHpMHo2gD1fxdsxOfttwj3KesGrV3ABa-kPg5KNCO1R6n8a0TRNCMIwhY7uVtgJg4PhBWwR7nAjCN2jnJ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VSpFdBs06Z75WQC-syQ9XLq7gMs0aPMvErv1U8ARYSVreExq2q600WuneP3CiJ_ITQ-p80I61wf5dIyKj2bKkw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wTClJ7ErMFkce65pNH1g_dR92vFQ2tTMlGDBuZ3